    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[<p>We are ready to provide you with advice or a quote.<br /><strong>Send us an enquiry <a href="/{localLink:umb://document/695010147d8a408a8922b1d1b4f1d905}#reachout" title="Head Office" data-anchor="#reachout">here</a></strong> or call <strong>066 299 1985.</strong></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Our accredited facilities are well-equipped to conduct a broad range of concrete strength, durability and integrity testing, according to any standard you require.</p>]]></Value>
